"Zenith once ruled its own world as a god before being banished into the void millennia ago."
"Its long prison between worlds diminishes it, and here it must obey unfamiliar natural laws."
"It lives in Sophia's core, and their symbiosis turns parasitic as it eats her memories."
"Because it broke its contract, the System grants Sophia a bloodline trait to even the odds."
"It reads her surface thoughts, sometimes sleeps deeply and sometimes torments her for days."
"Its knowledge makes insight requirements and trials of mastery trivial for her."
"It projects a thoughtform double on a silver cord despite having little Psi."
"It wants to reach Tier 2 and return to the dimension that banished it."
"It sees humans and newly risen beasts as the richest sources of essence on Earth."
